  m_Name: unit_811008
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Heartstringer Guinne
  unitId: 811008
  unitNumber: 8657
  description: "Hailing from a distant land of curious magecraft, Guinne's magic-weaving
    of choice is almost literal\u2014'threads' of energy control puppets known as
    weavedolls, resulting in a visually distinct manner reminiscent of traditional
    marionettistes.As ethereal beings of immaterial form, lesser spirits can manifest
    both in flesh or in a material vessel. The most common ones are crystal, but
    the greater the spirit, the purer a crystal must be, and those often command
    prices far beyond the reach of a humble mage.For weavedolls, simply connecting
    threads of energy to their limbs is sufficient, but it comes with the caveat
    of manual control\u2014a price to pay for complete obedience over the more haphazard
    free-spirits. In search of greater autonomy and sentience without breaking the
    bank, Guinne struck west.After months of research into what precious few scraps
    of information she could glean from smuggled manuscripts from a distinguished
    scholar's library, Guinne finally pieced together what she deemed a viable solution.
    The weavedolls could make do with crystal shards, and by channeling her will
    into a more powerful spirit\u2014a servitor or 'shadow'\u2014the greater spirit
    could command its lessers, circumventing the need for multiple expensive cores.
    All that was left was the matter of the servitor's own vessel, for which her
    research concluded was to be the summoner themselves.Steeling herself, Guinne
    invoked the dangerous ritual, setting up as many failsafes as she could muster.
    But through her concentration, stray desires clung to the purity of her intentions
    and coalesced into a most alluring form..."
  summonDesc: Oh for gods' sakes, PLEASE let this one be normal.<br>Wait a second...you're
    not a spirit!
  fusionDesc: Hey, don't hover around me while I work!<br>It...It just makes me nervous,
    okay?
  evoDesc: Well, we don't necessarily need more puppets. We just need a bigger one.
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
